	(text "  CC1200 UHF 432 MHz Matching Network                                                                                  \n  Source: M17 CC1200_HAT Rev B (SP5WWP/DB9MAT)                                                                         \n  Cross-ref: TI SWRR122 (CC1200EM 420-470 MHz)                                                                         \n                                                                  \n  All RF matching values are exact copies from the\n  M17 verified design (+14 dBm at 433.475 MHz).\n\n  3-path topology sharing single SMA antenna:\n    TX: PA → C2-L1-C1-L2-C3-L3-C4 → C10(DC block) → SMA\n    TRX: TRX_SW → C3 to TX path, L5 to balun center\n    RX: LNA_P/N differential balun (L6, L7, L8, C8, C9)\n    PA bias: AVDD → R6(18Ω) → L4 → PA, C5 bypass\n\n  Common parts per CC120X datasheet (SWRS123D):\n    Crystal: 40 MHz / 15 pF load caps\n    RBIAS: 56 kΩ (TIDR222 R14)\n    DCPL: 100 nF × 4 (pins 6, 21, 26, 29)\n    Bypass: 47 nF, 220 nF, 10 nF per TIDU921 BOM"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
